  "releaseNotes": "Coject Core Logging ASP.NET Core v1.8.10 applies the existing redacted, failure-only diagnostic payload capture policy to standard Operation controllers. AddCojectAspNetCoreRuntime globally registers the operation filter; failed actions capture only their already model-bound body and public response, successful actions discard the capture, and normal application logs remain value-free. Existing custom-procedure capture and audit behavior is unchanged.",
